        <tr><td>Ben Whittaker</td><td>The Intern (2015)</td><td><b>Referent</b> (integrity, positive attitude, respect and admiration)<span class="tr">(<b>Referente</b> (integridad, actitud positiva, respeto y admiración))</span></td></tr>
